{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>I am your father-in-law Jethro.</b> He prefaced by informing him, in the way of proper conduct, so that he could prepare a place for their stay, as the Sages said (Nedarim 16b): אַל תִּכָּנֵס לְבֵיתְךָ פִּתְאוֹם, כָּל שֶׁכֵּן לְבֵית חֲבֵרְךָ — \"Do not enter your own home suddenly, all the more so the home of your fellow.\""], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:26:02.357433737Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}